config BR2_PACKAGE_FPVOS_BOOTCHAIN
	bool "fpvos-bootchain"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_DTC
	help
	  The SD card's boot chain, made from the user's own stock
	  firmware (vendor/stock/uboot.img and boot.img, which
	  scripts/extract-vendor.py saves) by boot/mkbootchain.py:
	  a patched U-Boot, the kernel FIT with an SD-card device tree,
	  and the p1 fallback's kernel and device tree. Written to the
	  images directory for boot/mk-sd-image.sh.
